# pneuma three-plane requirements corpus — the symspec op stream that builds requirements.json
#
# Every record restates what the CODE does. `verificationNote` names the source file and line
# range, or the design-doc section, that the requirement was read off. Where a design claim and
# the code disagree, BOTH are stated and the disagreement is left for `symspec check` to prove.
#
# Rebuild with:
#   symspec init docs/formal/requirements/requirements.json --force
#   symspec apply --ops docs/formal/requirements/corpus.jsonl \
#                 --file docs/formal/requirements/requirements.json

